table:
  name: {{table_cost_reconciliations}}
  schema: {{schema}}
configuration:
  comment: "One stretch of one model checked against the provider's cost report."
insert_permissions:
  - role: {{server_role}}
    permission:
      check: {}
      columns:
        - complete
        - drift
        - ledgerByKind
        - ledgerCalls
        - ledgerCents
        - ledgerCredits
        - model
        - periodEnd
        - periodStart
        - providerByKind
        - providerCents
        - report
    comment: The server's own writes. No other role ever writes here.
select_permissions:
  - role: {{server_role}}
    permission:
      columns:
        - checkedAt
        - complete
        - drift
        - id
        - ledgerByKind
        - ledgerCalls
        - ledgerCents
        - ledgerCredits
        - model
        - notifiedAt
        - periodEnd
        - periodStart
        - providerByKind
        - providerCents
        - report
      filter: {}
      allow_aggregations: true
    comment: The server reads everything here.
update_permissions:
  - role: {{server_role}}
    permission:
      columns:
        - checkedAt
        - complete
        - drift
        - ledgerByKind
        - ledgerCalls
        - ledgerCents
        - ledgerCredits
        - notifiedAt
        - periodEnd
        - providerByKind
        - providerCents
      filter: {}
      check: null
    comment: The server's bookkeeping. Balances and money move only in the row-locked functions.
